			(property "Description" "Full-size SD card socket, push-push, with card detect and write protect switches, Hirose DM1AA-SF-PEJ(82) class. Drawn from the stock SD_Card_Receptacle with pins named for SPI mode and numbered for the stock footprint pads: 1 DAT3/CS, 2 CMD/DI, 3 VSS1, 4 VDD, 5 CLK, 6 VSS2, 7 DAT0/DO, 8 DAT1, 9 DAT2, CP card detect, WP write protect, SW the switch common, SH the shell. Which pad is the switch common and the switch polarity are from memory: to check against the data sheet."
