	(text "SPI mode: 1 CS, 2 DI, 5 CLK, 7 DO. DAT1 and DAT2 unused, pulled up.\nCP closes to SW, the common, with a card in: HOLO_CD low.\nWP open with the card's slider on LOCK: HOLO_WP high.\nWith no card WP reads high. Switch pads and polarity:\nfrom memory, TO VERIFY against the Hirose DM1AA data sheet.\nShell to GND. No TVS: the contacts sit inside the socket."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6e20a595-2a55-561c-95de-f2ae61f38282")
	)
	(text "Each SPI line meets J7 through its own\n33 Ohm at J7, a star from J1. MISO reaches\nthe card only: the display SDO is on JP3,\nopen, on the display sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 111.76 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "87db215c-d3a5-5e51-a350-892829f70390")
	)
