	(text "SD_3V3 feeds only the card and the DAT1, DAT2 pull-ups.\n+3V3 from the Pi has no room for a card: 120 + 100 mA.\nCard in live: C51 + C52 + C53 hold SD_3V3, U3 limits\nthe current drawn from +5V. Card up to 100 mA (to verify).\nU3 max input about 6 V (from memory, to verify)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
